sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Proposal as Proposal
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Proposal: accept(eventId)
    Note over Proposal: Policies: proposalRead, proposalWrite, proposalExecute
    Note over Proposal: Guards (3)
    Proposal->>Proposal: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;sent#quot; or self.status == #quot;viewed#quot;
    Proposal->>Proposal: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Proposal->>Proposal: guard[2]: self.expiresAt == null or self.expiresAt > now()
    Proposal->>Proposal: mutate.status
    Proposal->>Proposal: mutate.eventId
    Proposal->>Proposal: mutate.acceptedAt
    Proposal->>EventBus: emit ProposalAccepted on proposal.accepted
    Proposal-->>-Client: void